  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : [{(14 @ 6) @ (2 @ 3)} @ (1 @ 7)] @ 2 @ 4\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the '@' signs:\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ×, ÷, ×, ×, −, +, =\n\n[{**(14 × 6)**__ ÷ __**(2 × 3)**__} × __**(1 − 7)**__] + 2 = 4 \n\n[__**{84 **____**÷ 6}**__ × (-6)] + 2 = 4\n\n__**[14 × (-6)]**__ + 2 = 4\n\n__**-84 + 2**__ = 4\n\n-82 ≠ 4 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : −, +, ×, ×, ×, ×, =\n\n[{**(14 − 6)**__ + __**(2 × 3)**__} × __**(1 × 7)**__] × 2 = 4\n\n[__**{8 + 6}**__ × 7] × 2 = 4\n\n__**[14 × 7]**__ × 2 = 4\n\n__**98 × 2**__ = 4\n\n196 ≠ 4 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ×, −, +, ×, ÷, ×, =\n\n[{**(14 × 6)**__ − __**(2 + 3)**__} × __**(1 ÷ 7)**__] × 2 = 4\n\n[__**{84 - 5}**__ × 0.14] × 2 = 4\n\n__**[79 × 0.14]**__ × 2 = 4\n\n__**11.28 **____**× 2**__ = 4\n\n22.57 ≠ 4 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : −, +, ×, ÷, ×, ×, =\n\n[{**(14 − 6)**__ + __**(2 × 3)**__} ÷ __**(1 × 7)**__] × 2 = 4\n\n[__**{8 + 6}**__ ÷ 7] × 2 = 4\n\n__**[14 ÷ 7]**__ × 2 = 4\n\n__**2 ×**____** 2**__ = 4\n\n**4 = 4 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option - (4)\" is the correct answer.",
